{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24077","headline":"览镜喜老 · 白居易","name":"览镜喜老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝览明镜，须鬓尽成丝。\n行年六十四，安得不衰羸。\n亲属惜我老，相顾兴叹咨。\n而我独微笑，此意何人知。\n笑罢仍命酒，掩镜捋白髭。\n尔辈且安坐，从容听我词。\n生若不足恋，老亦何足悲。\n生若苟可恋，老即生多时。\n不老即须夭，不夭即须衰。\n晚衰胜早夭，此理决不疑。\n古人亦有言，浮生七十稀。\n我今欠六岁，多幸或庶几。\n傥得及此限，何羡荣啓期。\n当喜不当叹，更倾酒一巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}